                    <div class="card-body">
                        <h2 class="text-center" style="font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">AUTOART</h2>
                        <p>Autoart is one of the premium brands in the 1:18 industry. Autoart models in 1:18 scale were introduced in 1999 and models in 1:12, 1:43 and 1:64 scale were also eventually released, as well as slot cars and RCs in 1:24 and 1:32 scale. introduced. The range consists mainly of current and classic sports cars. A few years ago, Autoart started producing 1:18 scale models with plastic bodies and die-cast chassis.</p>
